== none
feature-m requires label
Usage: aicli add feature-m <label> <item>... [flags]
== no-multi-value
feature-m requires item
Usage: aicli add feature-m <label> <item>... [flags]
== repeated
item "openai" is given more than once
Usage: aicli add feature-m <label> <item>... [flags]
== repeated-trimmed
item "openai" is given more than once
Usage: aicli add feature-m <label> <item>... [flags]
== repeated-first-named
item "openai" is given more than once
Usage: aicli add feature-m <label> <item>... [flags]
== case
item must be one of: openai, claude, gemini, ollama
Usage: aicli add feature-m <label> <item>... [flags]
